window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>King Arthur is destined to return, and Tom is destined to wake him.</b></p> <p>When 16-year-old Tom’s grandfather mysteriously disappears, Tom stops at nothing to find him, even when that means crossing to a mysterious and unknown world.</p> <p>When he gets there, Tom discovers that everything he thought he knew about himself and his life was wrong. Vivian, the Lady of the Lake, has been watching over him and manipulating his life since his birth. Now she needs his help.</p> <p>Danger threatens the old forest of Vivian’s world. To save it, Tom must wake King Arthur, who’s been sleeping for centuries. </p> <p>Tom starts a journey that will change his life forever. He discovers that fey and magic still exist, and myths are very real.</p> <p>If he wants to survive, he must learn to fight, and find courage he never knew he had.</p> <p><b>If you love magic, mystery, and Arthurian legend, you’ll love </b><b><i>Call of the King</i></b><b>, book one of Rise of the King.</b></p> <p>Buy now for your next fantasy adventure.</p> <p><b>Important Note. This book was previous published as </b><b><i>Tom’s Inheritance: Tom’s Arthurian Legacy, Book 1</i></b><b>. It has been re-written and has extended scenes and a new ending.</b></p>"; 
